  "details": "Version:VRCSDK2-2020.04.03.13.11\nDescription of the bug:Selecting VRC_SyncVideoStream.SetSyncType in VRC_Trigger's Action will break VRC_Trigger's Inspector display, and you can't select a SyncType. And there's a lot of error logging.\nIf you check with the client after uploading, you will see that the SyncType is not set correctly.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):Just select VRC_SyncVideoStream.SetSyncType in VRC_Trigger's Action\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):",
